          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "contain"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " any peanuts in this salad dressing?"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "不好意思，這份沙拉醬裡面有含任何花生嗎？",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/checking-food-allergens/1.mp3",
